      "op": "test",
      "path": "/strings/research/crew1/1",
      "value": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nSure, there's merit to traveling with friends, but with mercenaries you won't need friends. Though 'reliable' mercs may pass you up, you can nonetheless hire some greenhorns eager for work at the ^orange;Science Outpost^reset;.\n\nHold ^green;shift^reset; while using a crew contract to satisfy your inner xenophobe, and guarantee a recruit of the same race as you."
